{
  "abstract": "{\"capability_summary\":\"用于创建DOU+订单，仅支持在DOU+完成企业入驻的客户调用且白名单管控，白名单需联系巨量引擎销售开通。\",\"id\":\"douplus.order.create\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/v3.0/douplus/order/create/\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"official_url\":\"1794677902211227\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"douplus.get_access_token\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"创建DOU+订单需要授权access_token，可通过此接口获取\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"},{\"id\":\"douplus.get_return_code\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710760866831\",\"reason\":\"创建订单接口的应答中返回码和返回信息的说明需参考此文档\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"附录-返回码\"}],\"risk_level\":\"low\",\"schema_url\":\"1794677902211227\",\"title\":\"创建订单接口\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-SHJ0QMeJ\">用于创建DOU+订单(注：此接口仅支持在DOU+完成企业入驻的客户调用且白名单管控，白名单请联系巨量引擎销售开通）</p>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201793219761166348%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201743864733602830%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-5mPWWmcK\" id=\"h346b9f0-5mPWWmcK\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-QXJNNQOH\"><a href=\"https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/douplus/order/create/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/douplus/order/create/</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1794677902211227\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1847394521222599\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-AKg1BLXe\" id=\"h346b9f0-AKg1BLXe\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-LN3VWL2W\">POST</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-Y66dbHUc\" id=\"h346b9f0-Y66dbHUc\">Header</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 332px;\" width=\"332\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 86px;\" width=\"86\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Access-Token</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-sdm79CAq\">授权access_token，可以通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\">获取Access token</a>】接口获取</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Content-Type</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-eZQ8ibjo\">请求消息类型<br/>允许值: <code><span style=\"color: #338aff;\"><span style=\"background-color: #f5f6f7;\">a</span></span><span style=\"color: #1890ff;\"><span style=\"background-color: #f5f6f7;\">pplicat</span></span><span style=\"color: #338aff;\"><span style=\"background-color: #f5f6f7;\">ion/json</span></span></code></p></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-JlOaQc3I\" id=\"h346b9f0-JlOaQc3I\">请求参数</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"request\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 331px;\" width=\"331\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 90px;\" width=\"90\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">aweme_sec_uid</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-x0tVwqV9\">抖音号ID，通过已授权账户接口可以获取</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 4px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">object_infos</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-c889YuTV\">选择投放物料</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-fbjnY3wx\">可批量填多条object，上限最多50条</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">marketing_goal</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-EpVztMFg\">营销目标(素材类型) </p><p data-id=\"p838747a-k2Xq1zcf\">可选值: </p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-I9GFR0j7\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-mH0ZRRHJ\"><code><span style=\"color: #2f54eb;\">VIDEO_PROM_GOODS</span></code> 视频类型</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-4RGXiPUI\"><code><span style=\"color: #2f54eb;\">LIVE_PROM_GOODS</span></code> 直播间类型</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">aweme_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-BRMkdfvY\">抖音号</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-a8Kfhr5E\">在手机端上看到的抖音号</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-INEBZ7P5\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-DWsUyoja\">视频加热和视频加热直播间：传递视频作者的抖音号</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-cNfszOEX\">直接加热直播间：传递主播的抖音号</li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-Y8uCQgBm\">素材类型为为直播(LIVE_PROM_GOODS)时，必填</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">item_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-jfFf1vr1\">抖音视频ID</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-d6n1dSmS\">当素材类型为视频加热和视频加热直播间：传递视频ID；</p><ol data-id=\"ob7246f7-3vwyJsWw\" start=\"1\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-SMGRTcni\">当marketing_goal= <code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">VIDEO_PROM_GOODS</span></code>时，必填</li></ol></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">external_action</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-rlGQhwgn\">投放目的</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-RmOhrtkF\">当素材类型为短视频(VIDEO_PROM_GOODS)时，允许值为：</p><ol data-id=\"ob7246f7-T3hcCBie\" start=\"1\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-BJUwYkOH\"><code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">LIKE_COMMENT_AMOUNT</span></code>点赞评论量</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-pjfWtvaE\"><code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">FOLLOWER_COUNT</span></code>粉丝量</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-DPC59DqU\"><code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">VIDEO_PLAYBACK_VOLUME</span></code>视频播放量</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-AAbAxc9t\"><code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">DY_PRIVATE_MESSAGES</span></code>抖音私信</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-yfZCGEuj\"><code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">HIGH_INTERACTION_QUALITY</span></code>高质量互动</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-0VXZCA9A\"><code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">ONLY_FOR_ACTIVATION</span></code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\"> </span>激活</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-T2Pn528X\"><code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">COMMENT_LINK_CLICK</span></code>评论链接点击</li></ol><p data-id=\"p838747a-60HFDtym\">当素材类型为直播(LIVE_PROM_GOODS)时，允许值：</p><ol data-id=\"ob7246f7-bm53R7TO\" start=\"1\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Nv5wJ6kV\"><code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">LIVE_ROOM_POPULARITY</span></code>直播间人气</li></ol></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">delivery_time</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>double</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-QjyVg1En\">投放时长</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-87ZXpZVu\">当marketing_goal= <code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">VIDEO_PROM_GOODS</span></code>时，支持<code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">2</span></code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">、</span><code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">6</span></code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">、</span><code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">12</span></code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">、</span><code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">24</span></code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">或12的倍数，最大720小时</span></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-Ko9ZSVoD\">当marketing_goal= <code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">LIVE_PROM_GOODS </span></code>&amp;liveroom_heat_mode<span style=\"color: #000000;\">=</span><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\"> </span><code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">BY_VIDEO </span></code>时，支持<code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">0.5</span></code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">、</span><code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">1</span></code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">、</span><code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">1.5</span></code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">、</span><code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">2</span></code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">、</span><code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">2.5</span></code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">、</span><code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">3</span></code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">、</span><code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">3.5</span></code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">、</span><code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">4</span></code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">、</span><code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">4.5</span></code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">、</span><code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">5</span></code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">、</span><code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">5.5</span></code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">、</span><code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">6</span></code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">、</span><code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">12</span></code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">、</span><code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">24</span></code></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-vzRwQEmh\">注：视频投放最短2小时</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">bid_type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-yw7ir4vx\">出价类型</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-sm4ZBfUE\">可选值:\n </p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-Y60eagAb\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-sJv4IUCu\"><code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">AUTO_BID</span></code>自动出价</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-VQSUae7z\"><code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">MANUAL_BID</span></code> 手动出价</li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-ZHZfcB27\"> 默认值:<code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">AUTO_BID</span></code></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">budget</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ciWsTTyx\">投放预算\n</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-NIeXhXsp\">注意：数值需为10,000-500,000,000之间的10的倍数，\n单位：人民币（分）</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">bid_price</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-jCM6pOhn\">手动出价金额</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-gwV8gFH2\">10～1,000,000之间的10的倍数，不高于投放金额，单位：人民币（分）\n注意：仅出价类型为<code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">MANUAL_BID</span></code>时，必填</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">liveroom_heat_mode</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-hWxZ8d2N\">直播间加热方式</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-eBdGAfOB\">可选值:</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-hB8wMBRA\"><code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">BY_ROOM</span></code>: 直接加热直播间</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-GACzB559\"><code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">BY_VIDEO</span></code>: 选择视频加热直播间</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-JwzQ2HQG\">注意：仅素材类型为<code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">LIVE_PROM_GOODS</span></code>，必填。可传多值</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-6WNW4CkW\">若传了<code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">BY_VIDEO</span></code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">，</span>则必须有素材类型为<code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">VIDEO_PROM_GOODS</span></code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\"> </span>的object，同理，若传了<code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">BY_ROOM</span></code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">，</span>则必须有素材类型为<code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">LIVE_PROM_GOODS</span></code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\"> </span>的object</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 4px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">targeting</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-PA8kNKFQ\">定向设置</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">audience_mode</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-LEeMsgP7\">想吸引的观众类型<span style=\"color: #f5222d;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fadb14;\">(自25年7月31日起不支持人群包投放！不支持DMP_PKG 这个枚举值了！！)</span></span></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-sF3md2yO\">可选值: </p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-bY3UBKaS\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-FdaZS2Gv\"><code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">AUTO</span></code> 系统智能推荐（默认）</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-mNYTSSiY\"><code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">CUSTOM</span> </code>自定义定向</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-AOzS2bUP\"><code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">AUDIENCE_PKG</span></code> 选择已有定向包id</li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-DO3cYMrp\"> 默认值：<code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">AUTO</span></code></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">gender</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-RxsTO9wL\">性别</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-LlTO292c\">允许值：\n</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-X55a3f2d\">\n</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-7Tld6V2i\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-IwSRYVTk\"><code><span style=\"color: #2f54eb;\">GENDER_FEMALE</span></code> 女性</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-zK1GO4uv\"><code><span style=\"color: #2f54eb;\">GENDER_MALE</span></code> 男性</li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-FUULTnbC\">注意：仅想吸引的观众类型为<code><span style=\"color: #2f54eb;\">CUSTOM</span></code>时，有效  </p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">age</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-u40Qlw2e\">年龄</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-nhk6B5T7\">允许值：若不传值，则默认为不限</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-Ypiw4YZf\">\n<code><span style=\"color: #2f54eb;\">AGE_BETWEEN_18_23</span></code>：18-23岁</p><p data-id=\"p83874